  id: 1_Konum
  title: "Yasak b\xF6lgeler"
  body: "\u2022 FAY HATTI: Kuzey Fay\u0131'na (haritada k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 \xE7izgi) de\u011Fen arsaya yap\u0131 yap\u0131lamaz.\n\n\u2022 DERE YATA\u011EI: Kara Dere ta\u015Fk\u0131n alan\u0131n\u0131n (haritada mavi tarama) i\xE7indeki arsaya yap\u0131 yap\u0131lamaz."
  dayIntroduced: 1
